# All at Sea (windurst 23): the two caps' tradeHas (not exact). Accepted by GM at Prog 0, a level-10 WAR at Windurst
# fame 125 in Windurst Waters. Baren-Moren: the Ripped Cap with a bone chip: 547 (0, Dhalmel Hide): Prog 1 (the cap
# taken, the chip kept). Port Windurst, Paytah: the Sailor's Cap (a GM's) with the chip: 295: completed (the cap
# taken, the chip kept; the mustZone).
lists WindurstWaters/Baren-Moren/onTrade WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/547 PortWindurst/Paytah/onTrade PortWindurst/onEventFinish/295
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-64.6,-2.875,-145.7 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Windurst 125
quest Windurst.AllAtSea accepted
item RippedCap
item SailorsCap
item BoneChip
login
trade Baren-Moren RippedCap x1 BoneChip x1    # Prog 0, the cap (tradeHas, not exact): 547 (0, Dhalmel Hide)
finish                                        # Prog 1; the cap taken, the chip kept
warp 79.5,-5,117.77 PortWindurst
trade Paytah SailorsCap x1 BoneChip x1        # the Sailor's Cap (tradeHas, not exact): 295
finish                                        # completed; the cap taken, the chip kept; the mustZone
